{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34001","headline":"新秋即事三首 二 · 皮日休","name":"新秋即事三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"堪笑高阳病酒徒，幅巾潇洒在东吴。\n秋期净扫云根瘦，山信回缄乳管粗。\n白月半窗抄术序，清泉一器授芝图。\n乞求待得西风起，尽挽烟帆入太湖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34001.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34001","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}